                `the Tan intestacy, the widow being guardian of the infant`
                `probate to the widow as guardian, limited until the infant obtains a grant` `the date of the hearing`

-- ... s 6(1)'s ceiling, again, on the realistic fixture. OVER-DETERMINED —
