#ASSERT NOT `s 21(2) — letters of administration may be granted to the guardian of the person and property of the infant` (`the Ong estate with` NOTHING EMPTY) `a grant to the widow alone` `the date of the hearing`
-- ... and the KIND: a grant of PROBATE is outside "letters of administration
