-- ... and the subsection's TWO GATES, neither of which had a failing case. Every
-- fixture above has EMPTY grants and no will, so "If no administration has been
-- taken out" and "who has died intestate" were asserted only on the side that
-- holds and could each be deleted with the suite staying green. The two estates
