                `a Family Court grant to the widow` `the further facts, nothing being made out` `the date of the hearing`

§§ `Scenario C — section 55, the six cases of delay`

-- (a) Tan Ah Kow died on 15 January 2025; at 1 January 2026 more than six
--     months have run and nobody has applied. The six months are CALENDAR
--     months from the death, so the boundary sits at 15 July 2025 — and the
--     expiry is strict, the day itself being too early.
#ASSERT `s 55(1)(a) — six months have expired from the death and no application has been made` `the Tan intestacy` `the date of the hearing`
#ASSERT NOT `s 55(1)(a) — six months have expired from the death and no application has been made` `the Tan intestacy` (YMD 2025 5 1)
#ASSERT NOT `s 55(1)(a) — six months have expired from the death and no application has been made` `the Tan intestacy` (YMD 2025 7 15)
#ASSERT     `s 55(1)(a) — six months have expired from the death and no application has been made` `the Tan intestacy` (YMD 2025 7 16)
-- ... nor where an application has been made, however it fared.
#ASSERT NOT `s 55(1)(a) — six months have expired from the death and no application has been made` `the Tan intestacy, the widow having applied` `the date of the hearing`

-- (b) an application made inside the six months and refused. The window is the
--     same calendar six months, and an application made ON 15 July 2025 is
--     "made within the said 6 months" while one made a day later is not.
`the Tan intestacy, an application refused` MEANS
    `a PAA deceased person` `Tan Ah Kow` `Tan Ah Kow’s family` `the estate of Tan Ah Kow` NOTHING EMPTY
        (LIST `a PAA application by` (`an individual` `Lim Mei Ling`) `letters of administration` (JUST (YMD 2025 3 1)) `refused`)
        (LIST `a PAA infant concerned in the estate` `Tan Xin`) FALSE
`the Tan intestacy, an application refused on the last day` MEANS
    `a PAA deceased person` `Tan Ah Kow` `Tan Ah Kow’s family` `the estate of Tan Ah Kow` NOTHING EMPTY
        (LIST `a PAA application by` (`an individual` `Lim Mei Ling`) `letters of administration` (JUST (YMD 2025 7 15)) `refused`)
        (LIST `a PAA infant concerned in the estate` `Tan Xin`) FALSE
`the Tan intestacy, an application refused a day late` MEANS
    `a PAA deceased person` `Tan Ah Kow` `Tan Ah Kow’s family` `the estate of Tan Ah Kow` NOTHING EMPTY
        (LIST `a PAA application by` (`an individual` `Lim Mei Ling`) `letters of administration` (JUST (YMD 2025 7 16)) `refused`)
        (LIST `a PAA infant concerned in the estate` `Tan Xin`) FALSE
`the Tan intestacy, an application not proceeded with` MEANS
    `a PAA deceased person` `Tan Ah Kow` `Tan Ah Kow’s family` `the estate of Tan Ah Kow` NOTHING EMPTY
        (LIST `a PAA application by` (`an individual` `Lim Mei Ling`) `letters of administration` (JUST (YMD 2025 3 1)) `not proceeded with`)
        (LIST `a PAA infant concerned in the estate` `Tan Xin`) FALSE
`the Tan intestacy, an application withdrawn` MEANS
    `a PAA deceased person` `Tan Ah Kow` `Tan Ah Kow’s family` `the estate of Tan Ah Kow` NOTHING EMPTY
        (LIST `a PAA application by` (`an individual` `Lim Mei Ling`) `letters of administration` (JUST (YMD 2025 3 1)) `withdrawn`)
        (LIST `a PAA infant concerned in the estate` `Tan Xin`) FALSE
`the Tan intestacy, an application proceeded with` MEANS
    `a PAA deceased person` `Tan Ah Kow` `Tan Ah Kow’s family` `the estate of Tan Ah Kow` NOTHING EMPTY
        (LIST `a PAA application by` (`an individual` `Lim Mei Ling`) `letters of administration` (JUST (YMD 2025 3 1)) `proceeded with`)
        (LIST `a PAA infant concerned in the estate` `Tan Xin`) FALSE
-- THE THREE FATES THE LIMB NAMES, and the two it does not.
#ASSERT `s 55(1)(b) — an application made within the 6 months has not been proceeded with, or has been withdrawn or refused` `the Tan intestacy, an application refused`
